@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Employee
participant ":System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : ask to create a scenario for a map
    activate System

        System --> Employee : Shows all existing maps
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects a map
    activate System

        System --> Employee : receives the selected map
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : types requested scenario data (name, description, restrictions)
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows all data and requests confirmation
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : confirms data for scenario creation
    activate System

        System --> Employee : displays success message (scenario created))
    deactivate System
@enduml